
# Secure Login System

## Project Description
A secure login web application developed using Python and Flask.

## Features
- User Registration and Login
- Password Hashing
- SQLite Database
- Input Validation
- SQL Injection Protection
- Session Management
- Logout Feature

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- Werkzeug
- HTML

## How to Run
1. Install Flask.
2. Run app.py in Pydroid 3.
3. Open http://127.0.0.1:5000 in your browser.

## Expected Outcome
A working login system with hashed passwords,
input validation, and session management.

